# .env is NOT used at runtime for this extension.
# API keys are entered by the user through the Settings tab inside the side panel
# (or via the Options page) and stored in chrome.storage.local on their device.
#
# This file is kept for documentation purposes only.
# Never commit a real .env with actual key values.

# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...   ← enter this in the extension Settings tab instead
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...     ← enter this in the extension Settings tab instead
